    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546930/extras/94dc9d321777eb1566d6d58baf07858d.avif?t=1729776588\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546930/extras/691e44c999e8056467a9f08a9a391c21.avif?t=1729776588\" /></div><br><br>Angry Angry shark is a fast pace shooter game where players aim to reach the highest rounds by killing as mush sharks as possible. You can play solo or with a group of 3 other friends as you fight against endless waves of man eating sharks.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546930/extras/d9af4dea59cc09336a39ce24ea880e87.avif?t=1729776588\" /></div><br><br>Solo mode<br>Multiplayer<br>Team Deathmatch<br>Search and Destroy <br>Deathmatch <br>Sharks<br>Weapon &amp; Character Customization<br>Leaderboards<br>Friends List<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546930/extras/cf385277dac2c4dc191622e86f4f248f.avif?t=1729776588\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546930/extras/1340563c1148690d9253e470ab519b15.avif?t=1729776588\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546930/extras/5c9e8c2aa2e8420146fdbf700d34783a.avif?t=1729776588\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546930/extras/82301457a3718e81035fe41ce4445b5a.avif?t=1729776588\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546930/extr